      "review_summary": "Adds no-op stdout/stderr error listeners to `execDockerRaw`, regression coverage for emitted stream errors, and a Docker sandbox stream-error proof script.\n\nPR surface: Source +2, Tests +27, Other +73. Total +102 across 3 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current `main` wires stdout/stderr `data` listeners without stream `error` listeners in `execDockerRaw`, and the Node stream probe confirms unhandled `error` events throw. I did not run Docker sandbox E2E in this read-only review.",
